OL,3,CFuneral set to take place for late-
OL,4,Csinger Bonnie Tyler who died aged 75
OL,6,FThe funeral for late-Welsh singer
OL,7,FBonnie Tyler will be held today
OL,8,F(Monday 17 August) in Swansea city
OL,9,Fcentre.
OL,11,FThe singer, whose real name was Gaynor
OL,12,FHopkins, died on 8 July in hospital in
OL,13,FPortugal at the age of 75.
OL,15,FOn Saturday, hundreds of friends and
OL,16,Ffans lined the streets in Mumbles as
OL,17,Fher coffin was driven home ahead of
OL,18,Fher private family funeral today.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/6
