OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1786945672
OL,3,CFuneral set to take place for late-
OL,4,Csinger Bonnie Tyler who died aged 75
OL,6,FAs the coffin, draped in the Welsh
OL,7,Fflag and accompanied by a framed
OL,8,Fphotograph of the singer, made its way
OL,9,Fdown Newton Road in Mumbles, the
OL,10,Ftearful crowd burst into applause and
OL,11,Fa rendition of Total Eclipse Of The
OL,12,FHeart.
OL,14,FToday's funeral service is taking
OL,15,Fplace at Swansea Minster at 12pm
OL,16,Fbefore the cortege makes its way to
OL,17,Fher birthplace of Skewen, Neath Port
OL,18,FTalbot.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/6
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
