OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1786945672
OL,3,CFuneral set to take place for late-
OL,4,Csinger Bonnie Tyler who died aged 75
OL,6,FEntry to the church will be for
OL,7,Ffamily, friends and invited guests
OL,8,Fonly.
OL,10,FAfter the service, her coffin will be
OL,11,Ftransported through Skewen at
OL,12,Fapproximately 1:20pm before a private
OL,13,Ffamily committal and farewell service.
OL,15,FTyler's death came just months after
OL,16,Fshe was treated in intensive care
OL,17,Fafter being placed in an induced coma
OL,18,Ffollowing an emergency intestinal
OL,19,Fsurgery.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/6
