OL,3,CFuneral set to take place for late-
OL,4,Csinger Bonnie Tyler who died aged 75
OL,6,FThe singer achieved international fame
OL,7,Fin the 1980s with the release of Total
OL,8,FEclipse Of The Heart, which shot to
OL,9,Fthe top of the charts in the UK and
OL,10,Fthe US.
OL,12,FFaster Than The Speed Of Night, the
OL,13,Falbum which featured the track, was
OL,14,Falso a chart-topping success and
OL,15,Flanded the singer her only UK number
OL,16,Fone album.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/6
