OL,3,CFuneral set to take place for late-
OL,4,Csinger Bonnie Tyler who died aged 75
OL,6,FRecognisable for her husky voice,
OL,7,FTyler released many other hits,
OL,8,Fincluding Holding Out For A Hero, It's
OL,9,FA Heartache and If You Were A Woman
OL,10,F(And I Was A Man).
OL,12,FShe represented the UK in the 2013
OL,13,FEurovision Song Contest in Malmo,
OL,14,FSweden, with the song Believe In Me,
OL,15,Ffinishing in 19th place.
OL,17,FFor members of the public wishing to
OL,18,Fpay their respects, the service at St
OL,19,FMary's Church will be shown on a large
OL,20,Fscreen in nearby St Davids Square.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G5/6
